# Summary
To create an agent with the weather tool using Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct, you can:
- Use ModelFactory.create() with ModelPlatformType.QWEN and ModelType.QWEN_2_5_14B (from enums.py)
- Use QwenConfig for model configuration
- Use WeatherToolkit to get weather tool functions
- Create a ChatAgent with system message, model, and tools from WeatherToolkit
- Refer to examples/models/qwen_model_example.py for Qwen model usage
- Refer to examples/toolkits/post_weather_on_twitter.py for usage of WeatherToolkit in an agent
- Refer to examples/agents/create_chat_agent.py for agent creation patterns

These files provide the necessary components and usage patterns to implement the requested weather agent script.
